# Copy to .env at this repo's root.
#
# This file is deliberately tiny. Every service's own credentials live in
# env/<service>.env (copy each env/*.env.example alongside it) — this root
# .env exists ONLY for values `docker compose` needs to substitute into a
# `command:` argument at parse time, which `env_file:` cannot do. Right now
# that's a single variable, for jellyfin-mcp's CLI-flag-based bearer token.
# See docker-compose.yml's jellyfin-mcp comment and README's "Dockhand fit"
# section for why this one is different from everything else in this stack.

JELLYFIN_HTTP_TOKEN=replace-with-a-random-secret-openssl-rand-hex-32
